From: Mrdindon <5002201+Mrdindon@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 23 Oct 2026 20:51:53 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 17/20] showmo: two-page web UI (live view + settings)

Replaces the stock web UI (post-build.sh prunes /var/www to a whitelist):
- index.html: 1 fps full-resolution MJPEG preview, snapshot, RTSP URL
- config.html: state, stream rate with a Default button (25 fps, 15 Mb/s),
  timestamp overlay (on/off, per-element size, time zone), RTSP and root
  credentials, SSH keys, camera name, Wi-Fi, reboot, firmware update
  (kernel + rootfs only: u-boot and settings are kept)
Login and sessions come from thingino-webui (root account).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
